---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Legal notice — AfriRank"
  description="Legal notice for afrirank.fr: publisher, host, intellectual property, personal data (GDPR) and cookies."
  active=""
  lang="en"
  frPath="/mentions-legales/"
  enPath="/en/legal-notice/">
<section class="hero hero--page wrap">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow reveal"><img width="918" height="832" src="/images/icon-orange.webp" alt="" /> Legal</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">Legal notice</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal">Legal information for the <strong>afrirank.fr</strong> website and its publisher. AfriRank is operated from France; this English version is provided for convenience and the French "Mentions légales" prevails in case of discrepancy.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap legal reveal">
    <p class="updated">Last updated: June 2026.</p>

    <h2>1. Site publisher</h2>
    <p>The <strong>afrirank.fr</strong> website is published by:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Advised</strong> — sole proprietorship operating the AfriRank brand</li>
      <li>Registered office: 161 chemin du Crêt de Montcher, 69210 Lentilly, France</li>
      <li>SIRET: 880 497 953 00021 (SIREN: 880 497 953)</li>
      <li>VAT: not applicable, article 293 B of the French General Tax Code</li>
      <li>Publication director: Francis Ndimba</li>
      <li>Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@advised-seo.fr">contact@advised-seo.fr</a></li>
    </ul>

